      "text": "hold to the one, and despise the other, Matt. 6:24 (Luke 16:13). despise not one of these little ones, Matt. 18:10. he that despiseth you despiseth me, Luke 10:16. despisest thou the riches of his goodness, Rom. 2:4. things which are despised, hath God chosen, 1 Cor. 1:28. ye are honourable, but we are despised, 1 Cor. 4:10. despise ye the church of God, and shame them, 1 Cor. 11:22. Let no man therefore despise him, 1 Cor. 16:11. He therefore that despiseth, despiseth not man, but God, 1 Thes. 4:8. Despise not prophesyings, 1 Thes. 5:20 (Jacob 4:8). Let no man despise thy youth, 1 Tim. 4:12. Let no man despise thee, Titus 2:15. He that despised Moses’ law died without mercy, Heb. 10:28. ye have despised the poor, James 2:6. them that … despise government, 2 Pet. 2:10. despise dominion, and speak evil of dignities, Jude 1:8.",
